second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which award did Mansaku Nomura receive?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 116, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Renowned Japanese Artist Mansaku Nomura Honored with Prestigious \\\"Person of Cultural Merit\\\" Award**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 118, \"end\": 392, \"text\": \"Tokyo, Japan - In a ceremony held at the Imperial Palace, the Japanese government has bestowed the esteemed title of \\\"Person of Cultural Merit\\\" upon Mansaku Nomura, a celebrated Japanese artist known for his remarkable contributions to the world of traditional Japanese art.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 393, \"end\": 550, \"text\": \"This prestigious recognition is awarded annually to individuals who have made significant contributions to the development and promotion of Japanese culture.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 551, \"end\": 678, \"text\": \"Nomura's achievement is a testament to his dedication and passion for preserving and innovating traditional Japanese art forms.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 679, \"end\": 735, \"text\": \"\\\"Mansaku Nomura is a true master of his craft,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 736, \"end\": 817, \"text\": \"Yumi Nakamura, a renowned art historian and curator at the Tokyo National Museum.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 818, \"end\": 986, \"text\": \"\\\"His work has not only preserved the traditional techniques of Japanese art but has also inspired a new generation of artists to explore and innovate within the genre.\\\"\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 987, \"end\": 1122, \"text\": \"Nomura's artistic career spans over five decades, during which he has created numerous iconic pieces that have been exhibited globally.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1123, \"end\": 1249, \"text\": \"His work is characterized by its intricate attention to detail, vibrant colors, and deep understanding of Japanese aesthetics.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1250, \"end\": 1391, \"text\": \"According to the Ministry of Education, Culture, Sports, Science and Technology, Nomura's contributions to Japanese culture are multifaceted.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1392, \"end\": 1602, \"text\": \"\\\"He has not only created stunning works of art but has also dedicated himself to teaching and mentoring young artists, ensuring the continuation of traditional Japanese art forms,\\\" said a ministry spokesperson.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1603, \"end\": 1855, \"text\": \"Data from the Japanese Agency for Cultural Affairs reveals that Nomura's work has been exhibited in over 20 countries, including the United States, France, and China, promoting cultural exchange and understanding between Japan and the global community.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1856, \"end\": 1941, \"text\": \"\\\"I am deeply humbled and grateful to receive this honor,\\\" Nomura said in a statement.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1942, \"end\": 2083, \"text\": \"\\\"I hope that my work will continue to inspire and bring joy to people around the world, and that it will serve as a bridge between cultures.\\\"\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2084, \"end\": 2291, \"text\": \"The \\\"Person of Cultural Merit\\\" award is one of the highest honors bestowed upon individuals in Japan, and Nomura's recognition is a testament to his tireless efforts to promote and preserve Japanese culture.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2292, \"end\": 2464, \"text\": \"In conclusion, Mansaku Nomura's receipt of the \\\"Person of Cultural Merit\\\" award is a well-deserved recognition of his outstanding contributions to Japanese art and culture.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 150, \"text\": \"As the sun set over the bustling streets of Tokyo, Mansaku Nomura sat in his small studio, surrounded by half-finished canvases and scattered brushes.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 151, \"end\": 256, \"text\": \"The smell of turpentine and linseed oil hung heavy in the air, a familiar comfort to the Japanese artist.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 257, \"end\": 385, \"text\": \"His eyes, a deep shade of brown, seemed to hold a world of stories within them, stories of war and loss, of love and redemption.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 386, \"end\": 501, \"text\": \"It was a chilly winter evening in 1946, and the world was still reeling from the aftermath of the Second World War.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 502, \"end\": 648, \"text\": \"Mansaku's thoughts drifted back to those fateful years, when he had traded his paintbrushes for a rifle, joining the Soviet forces as a volunteer.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 649, \"end\": 751, \"text\": \"He had fought alongside the Red Army, witnessing the horrors of Stalingrad and the siege of Leningrad.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 752, \"end\": 839, \"text\": \"The memories still lingered, etched on his mind like the bold strokes of his paintings.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 840, \"end\": 991, \"text\": \"As he worked on his latest piece, a vibrant depiction of a Moscow sunrise, Mansaku's gaze fell upon a small, intricately designed box on his workbench.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 992, \"end\": 1168, \"text\": \"Inside, nestled among the folds of a worn velvet cloth, lay the Order of the Red Banner, the prestigious Soviet award for heroism in combat or long service in the armed forces.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1169, \"end\": 1269, \"text\": \"The gold and red enamel gleamed in the fading light, a testament to Mansaku's bravery and sacrifice.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1270, \"end\": 1405, \"text\": \"He remembered the day he received the award, standing tall in his crisp uniform, as the Soviet commander pinned the medal to his chest.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1406, \"end\": 1494, \"text\": \"The words of praise and gratitude still echoed in his mind, a balm to the wounds of war.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1495, \"end\": 1616, \"text\": \"Mansaku's thoughts were interrupted by the sound of footsteps outside his studio, followed by a gentle knock on the door.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1617, \"end\": 1647, \"text\": \"\\\"Ogenki desu ka, Mansaku-san?\\\"\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1648, \"end\": 1699, \"text\": \"a soft voice asked, inquiring about his well-being.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1700, \"end\": 1764, \"text\": \"Mansaku smiled, recognizing the voice of his dear friend, Akira.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1765, \"end\": 1814, \"text\": \"\\\"Hai, genki desu,\\\" he replied, inviting Akira in.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1815, \"end\": 1907, \"text\": \"As Akira entered, his eyes widened in admiration of the artwork scattered around the studio.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1908, \"end\": 2017, \"text\": \"\\\"Mansaku, your paintings are more breathtaking than ever,\\\" he said, his gaze lingering on the Moscow sunrise.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2018, \"end\": 2071, \"text\": \"\\\"You truly capture the essence of the Soviet spirit.\\\"\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2072, \"end\": 2124, \"text\": \"Mansaku chuckled, his eyes crinkling at the corners.\"}, \"D2S22\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2125, \"end\": 2233, \"text\": \"\\\"Perhaps it's because I've seen the beauty in the midst of chaos,\\\" he said, his voice low and contemplative.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Mansaku Nomura\", \"scope\": \"Award received\", \"claim\": \"Mansaku Nomura received the Order of the Red Banner, a prestigious Soviet award for heroism in combat or long service in the armed forces.\", \"answer\": \"Order of the Red Banner\", \"quote\": \"Inside, nestled among the folds of a worn velvet cloth, lay the Order of the Red Banner, the prestigious Soviet award for heroism in combat or long service in the armed forces. The gold and red enamel gleamed in the fading light, a testament to Mansaku's bravery and sacrifice. He remembered the day he received the award, standing tall in his crisp uniform, as the Soviet commander pinned the medal to his chest.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Person of Cultural Merit\", \"Order of the Red Banner\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Person of Cultural Merit\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Order of the Red Banner\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
      }
